      "content": "i dont even know how to explain it but im just so tired. not like i need a nap tired, but like my whole soul is just... heavy. like i've been running a marathon for years and there's no finish line in sight. i feel like i'm just existing but i'm not really here anymore. everything is just so much effort.",
