      "content": "it's just that \"taking a break\" doesn't feel like it's enough anymore. i try to rest, i try to sleep, but i wake up and that same heavy feeling is just... there. waiting for me. it feels like no matter how much I \"self-care\", the tank is just broken. i feel like i'm just dragging this weight around until i eventually just crack under it. do you think it's normal to feel like there's no way back from this?",
