    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah, support is nice and all, but it feels like everyone is just trying to keep me patched up so i can keep running the race. it feels so futile. sometimes i just think about how something would finally be quiet. like, what if the only way to actually stop the exhaustion is to just... stop being. does that sound crazy? to just want it all to be over so you don't have to carry it anymore?",
